about='''<section class="about-hero wrap"><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow orange">JOHN H. GUESS / JHG PRODUCTIONS</p><h1>It started<br>with <em>an eye.</em><br>And a phone.</h1><p class="lead">Cinematographer. Filmmaker.<br>Storyteller. Creator.</p><a class="button primary" href="/contact/">Let’s work together ↗</a></div><div class="about-portrait"><img src="/assets/john-guess.webp" alt="John H. Guess in a purple shirt" width="1200" height="1600" fetchpriority="high"></div></section><section class="section wrap story"><p class="eyebrow orange">THE STORY BEHIND THE STORIES</p><div><h2>Curiosity became a craft.<br>Purpose made it a business.</h2><p class="lead">I began with a $10 camera phone, photographing the world along my daily route. I kept learning, kept creating, and eventually paid for a better phone through photography and video work.</p><p>That beginning still shapes how I work. I care about the people in front of the camera, the details around them, and the story they want to share.</p><p>When I met my wife Kimberly, her nonprofit, Nu Vizion Foundation 4 Lyfe, needed a way for people to see its work. Creating that platform strengthened something I already believed: small businesses, nonprofits, and communities deserve thoughtful visual representation.</p><p>JHG Productions brings that belief into films, photographs, interviews, promotional content, animation, and immersive environments. The tools keep changing. The purpose stays personal.</p><p class="signature">John H. Guess<span>FOUNDER · JHG PRODUCTIONS LLC</span></p></div></section><section class="statement"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE PROMISE BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2>Your dreams.<br><em>Our priority.</em></h2><p>We begin by listening. We create with intention.<br>We treat your story like it matters—because it does.</p></div></section>'''+cta()
